{'symbol': 'L', 'date': '2023-05-09 08:36:00', 'title': 'LOEWS CORPORATION ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': "NEW YORK , MAY 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LOEWS CORPORATION (NYSE: L) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE DECLARATION OF THE COMPANY'S QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.0625 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE JUNE 6, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 24, 2023. LOEWS CORPORATION IS A DIVERSIFIED COMPANY WITH BUSINESSES IN THE INSURANCE, ENERGY, HOSPITALITY, AND PACKAGING INDUSTRIES."}